OL,3,GNEWSADecision to reopen tip with
OL,4,Aculture cash examined
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision to divert #400,000 of
OL,7,Fculture funding in Bradford to reopen a
OL,8,Ftip in the district is to be
OL,9,Fre-examined by a cross-party panel of
OL,10,Fcouncillors.
OL,12,FEarlier this month, Bradford Council's
OL,13,FReform-led cabinet voted to reopen the
OL,14,FSugden End tip in Cross Roads, near
OL,15,FKeighley, by the end of the year.
OL,17,FThe decision was welcomed by many local
OL,18,Fresidents and politicians, but concerns
OL,19,Fwere raised over how the executive
OL,20,Fplanned to pay for it, and the impact
OL,21,Fof cutting arts funding to do so.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
