OL,3,GNEWSADecision to reopen tip with
OL,4,Aculture cash examined
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe executive's decision has now been
OL,7,F"called in" by Bingley Labour
OL,8,Fcouncillor Susan Fricker, and it will
OL,9,Fbe discussed by a scrutiny committee
OL,10,Fnext Tuesday.
